          "text": "`examples/go-todo-crud/` 目录包含有效的 `go.mod`，模块路径为 `examples/go-todo-crud`，Go >= 1.21；`go build ./...` 成功。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
