        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "get-list",
          "text": "`GET /todos` 返回 HTTP 200 + JSON 数组；空列表返回 `[]`；每个元素含 `id`(int)、`title`(string)、`completed`(bool)。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:/Users/apple/Developer/Personal/products/beacon/docs/beacon/v1.6.0/features/go-todo-crud-smoke/truth.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "post-create",
          "text": "`POST /todos` 接受 `{\"title\": \"...\"}`，返回 HTTP 201 + 创建的 TODO（默认 `completed: false`）；空 title 返回 400。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:/Users/apple/Developer/Personal/products/beacon/docs/beacon/v1.6.0/features/go-todo-crud-smoke/truth.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "get-by-id",
          "text": "`GET /todos/{id}` 存在时返回 200 + JSON；不存在时返回 404。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:/Users/apple/Developer/Personal/products/beacon/docs/beacon/v1.6.0/features/go-todo-crud-smoke/truth.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "put-update",
          "text": "`PUT /todos/{id}` 接受 `{\"title\": \"...\", \"completed\": true/false}`，成功返回 200 + 更新后 JSON；不存在返回 404；空 title 返回 400。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
